[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21123.31, "timestamp": "05:52:03", "text": "然後又開始大笑。搞什麼鬼？他們惡作劇了兩個人！他們帶著查瑪來了，鎮上又開始大笑。搞什麼鬼？好吧，好吧，媽媽得殺了整個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21124.948, "timestamp": "05:52:04", "text": "湖鎮！他們太過分了！這是什麼？這是什麼？這是什麼？他們太過分了！誰會做這種惡作劇？如果出了什麼事怎麼辦？他們會失去"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21135.067, "timestamp": "05:52:15", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "they then carried her to a stake"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21149.263, "timestamp": "05:52:29", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"LEAVE ME! WHERE IS MY CHILD!!\" she frantically screamed"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21154.91, "timestamp": "05:52:34", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "kronossss Kronos"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21161.873, "timestamp": "05:52:41", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "her voice echoing "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21164.27, "timestamp": "05:52:44", "text": "孩子，失去嬰兒。這對夫婦現在很困惑。好吧，他們腦子有問題。鎮上的人都不知道，他們為什麼要這麼做？他們一邊哭一邊大笑。搞什麼鬼？人們到底在幹嘛？哦，是嗎？我不知道。該死，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21174.669, "timestamp": "05:52:54", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so loud, it even rose above their chants"}]